<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12673"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, April 05, 2005 - 12:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey I saw Denny this morning at the carry out, i about fell over when he looked at me, He was delivering Diet Coke to the store. This might be funny but I did see his twin. I still think he looks like Goerge from Sienfield.  lol    Sheila<!--/Text--></td></tr>
