<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12692"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brown_tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brown_tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 06, 2005 - 3:58 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->THEY FOUND HIM, THEY FOUND HIM!!!! <BR> <BR>...police searching through the night for possibly valuable evidence against Dennis &#34;The Dawg&#34; Rader have found irrefutable evidence linking the BTK suspect to another murder. One they have not even considered before. <BR>Yes, they found Jimmy Hoffa.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
