<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12695"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 06, 2005 - 5:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve, <BR> <BR>I found the message entertaining, particularly the quote describing Monsieur Rader as a &#34;closet member of cross-country traversing cross-dressing serial-killing underwear fetishists who like to drive tan vans and gold volkswagen bugs.&#34; It sounds crazy, but seems highly likely. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
